# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a short jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim).
# Played by audio/jingles.js: game/travel.js, a portal not gone through before (into a cube not visited yet).
title    Portal
composer Claude
about    Through a new portal, briefly: a crystal swirl up, a glass harmonica chord, wind chimes, and the bird's wide call on the other side.
tempo    100
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.6

# mood explore: bird sweep harm chimes

voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.35 rev=0.8
voice sweep    crystal    vol=0.28 pan=-0.3 rev=0.7
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.24 pan=0    center=A4 att=0.4 rel=1.2
voice chimes   chimes     vol=0.36 pan=-0.35

pattern through
sweep   | E5 A5 B5 E6 A6 B6 .----- |
harm    | [Aadd9]?----------- |
chimes  | x..... ...... |
bird    | .----- E6 A5+B5---- |

loop through
